Third-party libraries used by the messages page, served from this server (nothing is loaded from a CDN).
Each was taken unmodified from its npm package; the tarball's integrity was checked against the registry.

marked     12.0.2   Markdown to HTML        marked/marked.min.js                  MIT (marked/LICENSE.md)
DOMPurify  3.4.17   HTML sanitiser          dompurify/purify.min.js               Apache-2.0 or MPL-2.0 (dompurify/LICENSE, LICENSE-MPL)
KaTeX      0.16.47  TeX mathematics         katex/katex.min.js, katex.min.css,    MIT (katex/LICENSE)
                                            katex/fonts/

The code editor of files mode, served from this server like the others. It is not one file of one package: it is
built once from npm packages by the recipe in tools/editor/ (exact versions, a lock file with every package's
integrity hash, the entry file and the command) into one minified file with one global, CodeMirror.

CodeMirror 6  codemirror 6.0.2, @codemirror/lang-markdown 6.5.2   code editor   codemirror/codemirror.min.js   MIT (codemirror/LICENSE)
              and what they depend on (@codemirror/state 6.7.6, view 6.43.15, language 6.13.1, commands 6.11.1,
              search 6.7.2, @lezer/markdown 1.8.1 and others); codemirror/LICENSE lists every package in the bundle
              with its version and licence text. Bundled by esbuild 0.28.2.

Fonts of the pages (Latin subsets, woff2), taken unmodified from their npm packages:

Inter           @fontsource/inter 5.2.8               fonts/inter-latin-{400,500,600}-normal.woff2    OFL-1.1 (fonts/LICENSE-inter)
JetBrains Mono  @fontsource/jetbrains-mono 5.2.8      fonts/jetbrains-mono-latin-{400,500}-normal.woff2  OFL-1.1 (fonts/LICENSE-jetbrains-mono)
Fraunces        @fontsource-variable/fraunces 5.2.9   fonts/fraunces-latin-wght-normal.woff2          OFL-1.1 (fonts/LICENSE-fraunces)

Chinese text uses the reader's system fonts; no CJK font is shipped.
